        <li><strong>CompTIA promotions:</strong> CompTIA periodically runs store discounts and bundle offers — check the CompTIA store and certification pages before paying list price.</li>
        <li><strong>CompTIA renewals (CE):</strong> most certifications renew every three years through Continuing Education, so the exam fee is not a monthly cost.</li>
        <li><strong>Academic route:</strong> CompTIA works with academic partners — ask your school or college about institutional exam pricing.</li>
